			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>UIAnimationDragCoefficient — lower is faster. 1.0 is stock and leaves the system value untouched; a respring then restores stock behavior. Disable Wake Animation affects turning the screen on, Disable Screen Off Fade affects turning it off. Fast Copy also applies inside apps and takes effect immediately.</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key><string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>defaults</key><string>cz.kolbi.sbtweaker</string>
